1. Information We Collect
We, the developer, do not directly collect, request, or store any personally identifiable information such as your name, email address, phone number, or precise location.

Data stored on your device
Your game progress (such as cash, level, store layout, settings, and purchase status) is saved locally on your device using the device's local storage. This data never leaves your device, is not transmitted to us, and is removed if you uninstall the Game or clear its data.

Data processed by third-party services
The Game integrates the following third-party services, which may collect and process certain data in accordance with their own privacy policies:

Google AdMob (advertising). AdMob may collect and use a device advertising identifier and related data to serve and measure ads, including limited data such as device type, general (coarse) location derived from IP address, and ad interaction data. See the Google Privacy Policy and how Google uses data.
Google Play Billing (in-app purchases). When you make an optional purchase, the transaction is processed by Google Play. We receive only confirmation that a purchase was completed — we never receive or store your payment card details.
Google Play Services. Standard services that support app functionality, distribution, and crash/stability reporting.
2. How Information Is Used
To save and restore your game progress locally on your device.
To display advertisements (including optional rewarded ads you choose to watch).
To process optional in-app purchases you choose to make.
To maintain, secure, and improve the stability of the Game.
3. Advertising
The Game is free and supported by ads served through Google AdMob. Some ads are rewarded ads that you may optionally choose to watch in exchange for in-game bonuses. Depending on your region and settings, ads may be personalized or non-personalized. You can control ad personalization and reset your advertising identifier through your device settings (for example, Settings → Google → Ads on Android).

4. In-App Purchases
The Game offers optional in-app purchases (such as starter packs, coin packs, and support items). Purchases are entirely optional and are processed securely by Google Play. We do not have access to your financial information. Purchases are subject to the Google Play Terms of Service.

5. Children's Privacy
We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. The Game is designed to be family-friendly. Where required, ads are configured to be served in a manner appropriate for a general audience. If you believe a child has provided personal information through a third-party service integrated in the Game, please contact us and we will assist in directing you to the appropriate service provider.

6. Data Sharing
We do not sell, rent, or trade any information. The only data processing that occurs is carried out by the third-party services listed in Section 1, each acting under its own privacy policy. We do not share any data with any other parties.

7. Data Retention and Deletion
Because game data is stored only on your device, you can delete it at any time by clearing the Game's data or uninstalling the Game. Data processed by Google (AdMob, Play Billing, Play Services) is retained and can be managed according to your Google Account controls and Google's policies.

8. Security
We take reasonable measures to protect the Game. However, no method of electronic storage or transmission is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.

9. Changes to This Policy
We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last updated" date. Continued use of the Game after changes take effect constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.

